<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.47 PERCENT TO 154.23.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.47 PERCENT TO 154.23.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rietumu Bank's index crept up 0.47 percent to 154.23 on Tuesday, the bank said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
